{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453660/extras/Image1_Steam.png?t=1743460314\" />Hit the arrow on the cherry. Sounds simple? Try it. <br><strong>Archerry</strong> is a 2D arcade game with a minimalist aesthetic and varied mechanics, as intuitive as they are challenging. Increasingly difficult obstacles in multiple game modes will demand the most of your precision. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">50 levels with progressively increasing and balanced challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique, simple, and challenging mechanics;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 game modes/difficulty levels;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Elegant and enjoyable neon/retro aesthetic;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Intuitive, casual, and highly replayable. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When the game tests the player, it becomes a matter of honor. Are you ready to master the perfect shot?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3453660?t=1743460314","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453660/052c2067005ef45fc67865001c7e46bdd6a26c96/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743460314","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453660/963bbde72505abcb661e6667a80a84726276178e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743460314","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453660/963bbde72505abcb661e6667a80a84726276178e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743460314","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"